From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UnlimitedBytes <admin@unlimitedbytes.ovh>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2026 10:44:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Pufferfish

Paper patches implementation of Pufferfish performance patches for 1.21.

Changes include:
- PufferfishConfig and PufferfishCommand
- DAB (Dynamic Activation of Brain) optimization
- Mob spawning optimizations with async executor
- Goal throttling and selector optimization
- Suffocation optimization
- Book itemstack validation toggle
- Projectile chunk loading optimization
- Shapeless recipe parallel matching
- Halloween check caching
- Entity tick list optimization
- End crystal placement config
- Flare profiler integration
- SIMD detection support
- TimingsExport with Pufferfish config

